      "text": "A twelve-second continuous cinematic fantasy fight. Real-time explosive action, athletic full-body motion, no slow motion. Begin from the supplied action pose: Arin, the young brown-haired paladin in white navy and gold plate, is on the left; the enormous faceless black silhouette Kael is on the right. In the first three seconds Kael drives forward in two long aggressive running steps, shoulders twisting, keeping his recognizable long violet starfield sword visibly in his RIGHT hand. He lunges and stamps his foot hard; his empty LEFT hand sweeps upward and fires a fast volley of stone shards. Arin rapidly sidesteps left, ducks, then springs sideways as rocks strike the floor where he stood. Between three and six seconds Kael pivots on his forward foot, makes a forceful left-arm cross-body strike casting a roaring fire burst, then snaps that arm overhead to lash branching lightning immediately afterward. Kael's legs, torso, shoulders and casting arm visibly move throughout the combo; he is an active advancing fighter. His sword stays the SAME violet starfield straight blade with the star-and-crescent gold guard, firmly in his right hand and visible beside his body. Arin blocks the fire with the blue-white gold-star kite shield on his LEFT forearm, cyan sword in RIGHT hand. Lightning erupts against his shield and a final shockwave knocks Arin off his feet: he falls backward, rolls once on the glossy black floor, and urgently pushes himself up behind his shield. Between eight and twelve seconds the magic clears. Kael sharply retreats and shrinks smoothly to normal human size far away on the right near the bright pillar. The camera settles into the precise supplied END frame: Arin standing in the left foreground in that exact bent-knee defensive pose, same shield and downward cyan sword, facing distant normal-size Kael. Finish in the exact endpoint composition and poses, no new move at the end. Preserve the dark reflective floor with gold seams, tall pillars and blue celestial nebula. Kael remains pitch black and faceless throughout, with no visible face, skin or armor details. The action has sharp whooshes, impacts, rumbling stone, fire rush and lightning crack; no dialogue, singing or music. Clear readable bodies, grounded footwork and dynamic but controlled camera tracking. No cuts, no text or lettering."
